# LilBattle env template — copy to configs/.env.dev (dev) or configs/.env (prod).
#
# A fresh clone runs WITHOUT this file. `make servelocal` defaults to local
# filesystem storage and username/password auth. You only need to set
# variables here when you want to change a default (customize the JWT
# secret, wire OAuth providers, point at Postgres, send real email, etc.).
#
# NEVER commit a filled-in copy. .env.dev and .env are gitignored for that
# reason.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Core (rarely needed in dev — code defaults work fine)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL used in email verification / password reset links.
# Default: http://localhost:8080
# LILBATTLE_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080

# Where the local FS backend writes games / worlds / users.
# Default: ~/dev-app-data/lilbattle/storage
# LILBATTLE_USER_STORAGE_PATH=~/dev-app-data/lilbattle/storage

# JWT signing secret for `ww login` tokens (CLI-side auth).
# Default: baked-in dev fallback. Change for anything non-throwaway.
# JWT_CLI_SECRET=change-me-for-any-real-use

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Backends (default: local in dev, pg in production)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Override the backend for either service. Values: local, pg, gae.
# The `-games_service_be` / `-worlds_service_be` flags on the binary win
# over these; `make servelocal` passes `-games_service_be=local
# -worlds_service_be=local` explicitly.
# GAMES_SERVICE_BE=local
# WORLDS_SERVICE_BE=local
# FILESTORE_BE=local

# Postgres — only needed when GAMES_SERVICE_BE or WORLDS_SERVICE_BE = pg.
# LILBATTLE_DB_ENDPOINT=postgres://postgres:password@localhost:5432/lilbattledb

# GAE / Datastore — only needed when GAMES_SERVICE_BE or WORLDS_SERVICE_BE = gae.
# GAE_PROJECT=your-gcp-project
# GAE_NAMESPACE=your-namespace
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=./configs/service-account.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Auth extras (all optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Skip auth entirely — anonymous everything. Dev-only shortcut. Bypasses
# the interceptor AND handler-side authz. NEVER set in production.
# DISABLE_API_AUTH=true

# Enable the ?dev_user=<handle> fake-login for multi-window testing without
# real signup. Dev-only. See docs/DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md → "Dev-mode fake login".
# ENABLE_DEV_FAKE_LOGIN=true

# Allow x-switch-user impersonation headers (integration testing).
# ENABLE_SWITCH_AUTH=true

# OAuth providers (all optional — signup + password login work without them).
# OAUTH2_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
# OAUTH2_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# OAUTH2_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# OAUTH2_GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL=http://localhost:8080/auth/google/callback/
# OAUTH2_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
# OAUTH2_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# OAUTH2_GITHUB_CALLBACK_URL=http://localhost:8080/auth/github/callback/
# OAUTH2_TWITTER_CLIENT_ID=
# OAUTH2_TWITTER_CLIENT_SECRET=
# OAUTH2_TWITTER_CALLBACK_URL=http://localhost:8080/auth/twitter/callback/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Email + file storage (production, optional in dev)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Resend for verification / reset emails. Empty falls back to a console
# sender that just prints the message — perfectly fine for dev.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=LilBattle <noreply@lilbattle.com>

# Cloudflare R2 (or S3) — only needed when FILESTORE_BE = r2.
# R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
# R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
# R2_ENDPOINT=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Feature flags
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hide games UI / worlds UI (routes still respond to API calls).
# LILBATTLE_HIDE_GAMES=false
# LILBATTLE_HIDE_WORLDS=false

# Ads (production only, all default to enabled).
# LILBATTLE_ADS_ENABLED=true
# LILBATTLE_AD_NETWORK_ID=
# LILBATTLE_AD_SLOT_ID=
